abstract: >-
  Plain-text corpus of German federal Christmas addresses (Weihnachtsansprachen)
  compiled for digital philological and computational text analysis. The initial
  release (v0.1.0) covers the addresses delivered by Konrad Adenauer as
  Bundeskanzler between 1949 and 1962 (14 texts). Files are encoded in UTF-8
  with preserved original orthography. The corpus is designed for incremental
  expansion across additional speakers and periods.
